number: 481
title: How Beautiful the Feet
author: Anonymous
composer: W. H. Eisele
sp_category: "29"
topic: Work and Duty
notes: "AUTO: chorus detected heuristically — verify"
---

[verse 1]
How beautiful the feet of those
Who spread the Gospel cheer;
Salvation’s tidings they disclose
To men both far and near.

[chorus]
Hallelujah, we praise the Lord alway,
Who is building His Kingdom here today.
O Lord, send out more messengers,
Because the need is great;
And there are many needy hearts
Who for Thy Gospel wait.

[verse 2]
O Lord send out more messengers,
