[verse 3]
Tho’ evil threatens everywhere,
Fear not the tempest shock;
The Church in triumph standeth sure,
Upon the solid Rock.

[chorus]
Hallelujah, we praise the Lord alway,
Who is building His Kingdom here today.
O Lord, send out more messengers,
Because the need is great;
And there are many needy hearts
Who for Thy Gospel wait.
